{"availability":"available","full":"RCushmaniii/ai-portfolio","name":"ai-portfolio","description":"Static portfolio system that syncs project data from GitHub repos into a filterable, bilingual showcase — Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-01-05T15:06:48Z","updated":"2026-10-09T14:52:57Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-portfolio-cushlabs.vercel.app/","topics":["github-api","nextjs","portfolio","react","shadcn-ui","static-site","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://ai-portfolio-cushlabs.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:08.966Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:08.966Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:08.966Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:08.966Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A bilingual (EN/ES) static portfolio system that aggregates project data from GitHub repositories and renders a professional, filterable showcase with SEO optimization and WebP images.","AI Portfolio is a Next.js application that powers the project showcase at cushlabs.ai. Rather than maintaining portfolio content in a CMS or database, each GitHub repository contains a PORTFOLIO.md file with structured YAML frontmatter. A sync script fetches these files, validates them with Zod, enriches the data with GitHub API metadata (stars, forks, language, topics), and generates a static JSON file consumed at build time.","The result is a fast, reliable portfolio site with zero runtime API dependencies. Content updates happen through a simple workflow: edit PORTFOLIO.md in any repo, run the sync script, and deploy."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RCushmaniii/ai-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0a38b2661e2e8616135be0a8afdad61ea4de732eadfc1f0995247f8d0b9614a7","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:09.099Z"},"overviewCh